      💙 *QUR'AN-E-MAJEED* 💙

✨ *Qur'an Majeed kya hai?* 

✅Ye Allah ka kalaam hai, ya yun samjhlo ke ye Allah ki baatein hain jo isne apne pyare Nabi Mohammed (ﷺ) par Hazrat Jibrael(AS)  ke zariye se behji taake humko maloom hojaye ke Allah Ta'ala kaun hai?

✅Duniya mein kaun kaun si baatein karne ki hai jin se Allah Ta'ala khush hota hai aur kaun si baatein chord ne ki hai jin se Allah Ta'ala naraz hota hai.

✅Marne ke baad humko Qayamat ke roz dobara zinda kiya jayega taake jis ne Allah Ta'ala aur uske Rasool ke bataye hue achche kaam kiye ho iske badle isko jannat mile aur wo wahan hamesha hamesha rahe aur jo iska jee chahe wo isko mile, aur jisne aise kaam kiye jin ko Allah Ta'ala aur uske Rasool ne karne se mana kiya hai use iski saza dozakh mein bhugatna padegi, jis ne Allah Ta'ala ke saath shirk kiya hai isko mu'af nahi kiya jayega, iske alwa wo Allah Ta'ala rahem karne wala hai jis ko chahe bakhshde.
